{"h":3395,"w":2400,"lines":[{"c":1,"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.096707817249561623,"y":0.06976744171613769,"w":0.12139918009440104,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"y":0.11635546182037104,"t":"TC EMPLOYEE:","w":0.099329185485839841,"h":0.011848521597674688,"x":0.10052156381723577,"c":1},{"t":"VISITOR:","x":0.10079790280873674,"h":0.0088882378891584901,"c":1,"y":0.13363727638780898,"w":0.057663453420003258},{"y":0.14805389208956665,"x":0.098527415676421037,"t":"TC EMPLOYEE:","h":0.01149042419325752,"c":1,"w":0.10338672002156576},{"t":"TC EMPLOYEE:","y":0.22673733809425789,"h":0.0088339222614840507,"c":1,"w":0.10082304636637371,"x":0.10082304461516706},{"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1,"x":0.10288065958045015,"t":"TC EMPLOYEE:","y":0.34883720915437033,"w":0.098765430450439451},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.46502059936523432,"t":"R-A-T-C-H-E-S-O-N-S. It's just by the cruise ship terminal.","x":0.21399175783674859,"c":1,"y":0.11482558126117115},{"y":0.13081395331631251,"c":1,"x":0.21399176992644423,"t":"OK.","w":0.03497942288716635,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"c":1,"y":0.14301379460140806,"h":0.016218525782069504,"w":0.62362370808919265,"t":"You'd also need to pick up a repair kit for the bike from there to take along with","x":0.21597123789556813},{"h":0.017608859373346553,"w":0.6298621114095051,"x":0.21591943605982428,"y":0.15845137078682092,"t":"you, and you'd need to take along a snack and some water - it'd be best to get","c":1},{"c":1,"t":"those in the city.","x":0.21604938202432122,"w":0.12962963104248049,"h":0.011778563015312216,"y":0.17726737343113119},{"c":1,"x":0.21592692261847587,"t":"Fine. That shouldn't be a problem. And I assume I can rent a helmet from the","y":0.1891613900880893,"w":0.61135965983072915,"h":0.018802522630096075},{"h":0.015161632227813415,"y":0.20753546280588109,"x":0.21595493190183793,"c":1,"t":"bike place?","w":0.094839108784993492},{"w":0.59910705566406253,"h":0.01943520297712098,"x":0.2158793132925691,"y":0.21925793917066483,"c":1,"t":"Sure, you should definitely get that. It's a great ride, but you want to be well"},{"c":1,"w":0.61337153116861987,"t":"prepared because it's very remote - you won't see any shops round there, or","x":0.21594199093323388,"h":0.016533373101439985,"y":0.23659478132420264},{"y":0.2518022184704567,"h":0.015807704453754789,"c":1,"t":"anywhere to stay, so you need to get back in time for the last boat.","w":0.52696395874023438,"x":0.21797703493119086},{"t":"Yeah. So what sort of prices are we looking at here?","y":0.26737985501301575,"w":0.41590179443359376,"x":0.21799591836983134,"h":0.016658740835560515,"c":1},{"y":0.28270058620913585,"w":0.57005655924479171,"t":"Let's see, that'd be one adult and one child for the cruise with farm tour,","x":0.21804373041601177,"h":0.015495574376046761,"c":1},{"y":0.29741451578133593,"w":0.60925216674804683,"x":0.2180075719440587,"h":0.017077850930401595,"c":1,"t":"that's $117, and an adult and a child for the cruise only so that's $214 dollars"},{"c":1,"t":"altogether. Oh, wait a minute, how old did you say your daughter was?","h":0.019998669483917153,"w":0.56205500284830734,"y":0.31222077663148551,"x":0.21589967541018429},{"t":"Then I'm afraid it's $267 because she has to pay the adult fare, which is $75","y":0.34280905639409764,"w":0.60529810587565103,"h":0.020924335654969761,"x":0.21794699348467741,"c":1},{"t":"instead of the child fare which is $22 - sorry about that.","c":1,"y":0.36042402838947651,"h":0.014575971731448756,"x":0.21604938308351412,"w":0.44238683064778644},{"x":0.21985266910396803,"t":"That's OK. Er, so how do ...","y":0.37541224795193551,"h":0.01711030899425281,"w":0.22073649088541666,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.016046580212416672,"w":0.15637860616048177,"x":0.10288065570537915,"t":"SECTION 2","y":0.42726737340454879},{"y":0.45334774578395165,"w":0.69356460571289058,"h":0.015720360691892754,"c":1,"x":0.10486673352094272,"t":"Good morning everyone. My name's Joy Parkins and I'm the restaurant manager. And I"},{"x":0.10280516382188286,"h":0.017156955912200234,"w":0.71000244140625002,"c":1,"y":0.46890138726840069,"t":"understand that none of you've had any previous experience as kitchen assistants? Well,"},{"x":0.10068711728333038,"y":0.48341495897551257,"w":0.73688481648763027,"t":"you might be feeling a bit nervous now, but most of our kitchen assistants say they enjoy the","c":1,"h":0.018922646278767719},{"c":1,"t":"work. OK, they might get shouted at sometimes, but it's nothing personal, and they're pleased Q11","x":0.10274023513846932,"h":0.020074351235469412,"w":0.79040196736653656,"y":0.49785574897830398},{"y":0.51514926646398462,"h":0.016700036955385245,"x":0.10279776600499115,"t":"that they have so many different things to do, which means they never get bored. And I'll","w":0.70388366699218752,"c":1},{"x":0.10276304975837831,"w":0.72658137003580725,"c":1,"t":"tell you straightaway that if you do well, we might think about moving you up and giving you","y":0.52944949103169892,"h":0.01903492373768656},{"x":0.10493827457963609,"y":0.54796511610701026,"w":0.20576131184895832,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"t":"some more responsibility."},{"h":0.021706244128331664,"c":1,"t":"Right, well, you've all shown up on time, which is an excellent start. Now I'm glad to see none","x":0.10480846694685358,"y":0.56736120110093424,"w":0.7430684916178385},{"y":0.58367529957239839,"w":0.7429898579915365,"h":0.018207984200916849,"t":"of you have unsuitable footwear, so that's good - you need to be careful as the floors can get","c":1,"x":0.1048542897417292},{"c":1,"h":0.019270662143738737,"x":0.10277320951713496,"t":"very wet and slippery. Those of you with long hair have got it well out of the way, but some of","y":0.59863966539274793,"w":0.74301310221354167},{"t":"you'll need to remove your rings and bracelets - just put them somewhere safe for today, and","x":0.10481350623467099,"y":0.6143412040859525,"h":0.017978147005725975,"w":0.74301971435546876,"c":1},{"x":0.10485792633698381,"w":0.60712427775065103,"h":0.016474657541731164,"c":1,"t":"remember to leave them at home tomorrow, as they can be a safety hazard.","y":0.63054257747773812},{"h":0.0192889684221067,"w":0.69574427286783846,"c":1,"x":0.10478916328321693,"t":"Now it's going to be a busy day for you all today - we don't have any tables free for this","y":0.65201306559055261},{"x":0.10482794895672934,"t":"evening, and only a few for lunch. Fortunately we've got our Head Chef back - he was away","w":0.73477549235026041,"h":0.018185332470142312,"y":0.66816533885854668,"c":1},{"h":0.018705471946437791,"t":"on holiday all last week which meant the other chefs had extra work. Now, I'll tell you a bit","x":0.10481806890992725,"y":0.68376107100835082,"w":0.7142429097493489,"c":1},{"y":0.69953277398012059,"h":0.018453571063469676,"x":0.10482735388287694,"t":"more about the job in a minute but first, some general regulations. For all of you, whatever","w":0.71833206176757813,"c":1},{"t":"your age, there's some equipment you mustn't use until you've been properly trained, like","c":1,"y":0.7149801893790444,"w":0.71215469360351558,"x":0.10481057491411548,"h":0.018132071051356058},{"y":0.73110465101164279,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"x":0.10493827764819012,"t":"the waste disposal system for example, for health and safety reasons. Then I think there are.","w":0.73868311564127609},{"c":1,"t":"two of you here who are under 18 - that's Emma and Jake, isn't it? Right, so for you two, the","w":0.73890126546223955,"h":0.018979442133639557,"x":0.10481186308461966,"y":0.74443008712043401},{"y":0.76136652069725774,"w":0.73270065307617194,"h":0.017803180905758831,"c":1,"x":0.1068946533235004,"t":"meat slicer is out of bounds. And of course none of you are allowed to use the electric mixer"},{"h":0.015324236506988886,"w":0.30270263671874997,"t":"until you've been shown how it works.","y":0.77859056712680474,"x":0.10891560884881273,"c":1},{"t":"Now you may have heard that this can be a stressful job, and I have to say that can be true.","y":0.79902383456686354,"x":0.10686669228037678,"h":0.02005471947336368,"c":1,"w":0.7306976318359375},{"c":1,"y":0.81462459774062945,"t":"You'll be working an eight-hour day for the first week, though you'll have the chance to do","h":0.019366858564361156,"w":0.71014785766601562,"x":0.10686242356366553},{"c":1,"y":0.82954557430588682,"h":0.018674908875014995,"w":0.72444920857747397,"t":"overtime after that as well if you want to. But however long the hours are, you'll get a break","x":0.10690753941559497},{"c":1,"t":"in the middle. What you will find is that you're on your feet all day long, lifting and carrying, so","x":0.10699587351551713,"y":0.84738372079398361,"w":0.74074076334635419,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"x":0.10689395377209014,"t":"if you're not fit now you soon will be! You'll find you don't have much chance to take it easy","h":0.018245513925001955,"c":1,"y":0.86123842825061214,"w":0.72037755330403652},{"c":1,"h":0.017807528043102261,"x":0.10688508201042396,"y":0.87638044517682068,"t":"when someone tells you to do something you need to do it straightaway - but at least we do","w":0.73273417154947906},{"y":0.89252608552324675,"h":0.016442243847886284,"x":0.11099991040758482,"t":"have a very efficient air conditioning system compared with some kitchens.","c":1,"w":0.59482899983723958},{"c":1,"h":0.014534883982160851,"y":0.94186046484031483,"x":0.10905349759012732,"t":"96","w":0.026748971939086916},{"c":1,"h":0.016453971009091628,"w":0.2082209142049154,"y":0.96768258519867956,"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.39483721545198913}]}